@MidisSqlAi.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7238

### Database health

GET {{MidisSqlAi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/database/health
Accept: application/json

### Database schema

GET {{MidisSqlAi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/schema
Accept: application/json

### Prompt-friendly database schema

GET {{MidisSqlAi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/schema/prompt
Accept: application/json

### Validate safe SQL

POST {{MidisSqlAi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sql/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sql": "SELECT TOP 10 TicketId, Title, Status FROM Tickets;"
}

### Validate dangerous SQL

POST {{MidisSqlAi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sql/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sql": "DELETE FROM Tickets;"
}